ry (or they\u2019re just that fragile). But it\u2019s not as easy as it sounds \u2013 You must <strong>stress</strong> the Hooman first. You do that using the environment and its tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/2a15347bef8890667681e5f2426b0241.webp?t=1758561610\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/17f092d75e3e7157a54a326e160edd73.poster.avif?t=1758561610\" width=1170 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/17f092d75e3e7157a54a326e160edd73.webm?t=1758561610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure them with a cute purrr, throw bottles, snap twigs, sabotage lights, frozen yeti jumpscares, dance around dangerous traps\u2026 Shoo\u2019s toolkit is full of mischief. There\u2019s no \u201cright\u201d way to scare off a Hooman, so get inventive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/4ad5d208e3cae1a1335ff58088696b92.webp?t=1758561610\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/c97d3df6521e6c5b2ac091c3fe43e3be.poster.avif?t=1758561610\" width=1170